1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,111
Video ya leo ni nini? Ni "Kuzungumza Kuhusu Hisia".

2
00:00:09,111 --> 00:00:17,383
Katika sehemu fulani ya video, utaulizwa swali kwa Kijapani. Ukishasikia, tafadhali uandike maoni.

3
00:00:18,343 --> 00:00:21,343
Sehemu ya 1: Kuzungumza Kuhusu Filamu

4
00:00:21,343 --> 00:00:25,550
Hivi majuzi, nimeangalia filamu nyingi.

5
00:00:25,574 --> 00:00:27,552
Nzuri sana!

6
00:00:27,576 --> 00:00:30,543
Umeangalia filamu za aina gani?

7
00:00:30,566 --> 00:00:36,299
Nimeangalia filamu za hatua, za kutisha na za katuni.

8
00:00:36,322 --> 00:00:39,089
Umeangalia nyingi sana!

9
00:00:39,112 --> 00:00:42,358
Filamu za hatua zilikuwaje?

10
00:00:42,381 --> 00:00:45,192
Zilikuwa nzuri sana.

11
00:00:45,216 --> 00:00:48,983
Mwanaume alikuwa mrembo sana.

12
00:00:49,006 --> 00:00:51,661
Je, filamu ilikuwa na kelele nyingi?

13
00:00:51,684 --> 00:00:55,327
Ndiyo, ilikuwa na kelele nyingi sana.

14
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:58,629
Gari nyingi zilikuwa zikikimbia.

15
00:00:58,653 --> 00:01:01,586
Hiyo inaonekana nzuri.

16
00:01:01,609 --> 00:01:04,448
Filamu za kutisha zilikuwaje?

17
00:01:04,471 --> 00:01:08,366
Filamu za kutisha zilikuwa zinaogopesha sana.

18
00:01:08,390 --> 00:01:10,957
Zilikuwa nzuri?

19
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:15,386
Hapana, hazikuwa nzuri sana.

20
00:01:15,409 --> 00:01:17,303
Kwa nini?

21
00:01:17,327 --> 00:01:22,994
Kwa sababu kulikuwa na sehemu nyingi za giza, sikuelewa vizuri.

22
00:01:23,017 --> 00:01:25,017
Nimeelewa.

23
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:28,240
Filamu za kutisha ni ngumu.

24
00:01:28,263 --> 00:01:34,096
Ndiyo, usiku wa jana sikupata usingizi kabisa.

25
00:01:34,119 --> 00:01:37,586
Hiyo ilikuwa ngumu sana.

26
00:01:37,609 --> 00:01:40,375
Filamu za katuni zilikuwaje?

27
00:01:40,398 --> 00:01:44,332
Filamu za katuni zilikuwa za furaha sana.

28
00:01:44,355 --> 00:01:46,526
Zilikuwa na hadithi gani?

29
00:01:46,549 --> 00:01:50,116
Wanyama wadogo waliotamu walikuwepo wengi.

30
00:01:50,139 --> 00:01:52,872
Muziki pia ulikuwa mzuri.

31
00:01:52,895 --> 00:01:55,229
Picha zilikuwa nzuri?

32
00:01:55,253 --> 00:01:59,053
Ndiyo, picha zilikuwa nzuri sana.

33
00:01:59,076 --> 00:02:01,209
Nilikua na hisia nzito.

34
00:02:01,232 --> 00:02:05,766
Kati ya filamu hizo tatu, ni ipi unayopenda zaidi?

35
00:02:05,789 --> 00:02:09,284
Ninapenda zaidi filamu za katuni.

36
00:02:09,307 --> 00:02:11,674
Ningependa kuziangalia tena.

37
00:02:11,697 --> 00:02:15,501
Mimi ninapenda filamu za hatua.

38
00:02:15,525 --> 00:02:17,939
Je, tutaangalia pamoja siku nyingine?

39
00:02:17,962 --> 00:02:19,729
Nzuri sana!

40
00:02:19,752 --> 00:02:22,085
Twende pamoja.

41
00:02:22,108 --> 00:02:25,242
Jumamosi ya wiki ijayo itakuwaje?

42
00:02:25,266 --> 00:02:28,302
Jumamosi ni sawa.

43
00:02:28,326 --> 00:02:30,659
Tutakwenda saa ngapi?

44
00:02:30,682 --> 00:02:33,286
Saa nane mchana itakuwaje?

45
00:02:33,309 --> 00:02:35,161
Nzuri sana!

46
00:02:35,184 --> 00:02:38,761
Tutakwenda sinema karibu na kituo cha treni?

47
00:02:38,785 --> 00:02:43,318
Ndiyo, hiyo ni mpya na kubwa.

48
00:02:43,341 --> 00:02:45,078
Nimeelewa.

49
00:02:45,102 --> 00:02:47,754
Bei ya tiketi ni ngapi?

50
00:02:47,777 --> 00:02:50,377
Elfu mbili za Kijapani.

51
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,800
Mimi nitanunua.

52
00:02:52,823 --> 00:02:54,633
Asante sana.

53
00:02:54,656 --> 00:02:56,701
Nashangaa!

54
00:02:56,725 --> 00:02:59,725
Hapana, karibu.

55
00:02:59,748 --> 00:03:01,751
Inasikitisha sana!

56
00:03:01,775 --> 00:03:06,627
Ndiyo, mimi pia napenda filamu za hatua.

57
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:09,017
Tukale popkorn pia.

58
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:10,894
Nzuri sana!

59
00:03:10,917 --> 00:03:14,684
Napenda popkorn tamu.

60
00:03:14,707 --> 00:03:19,840
Mimi napenda popkorn ya chumvi, basi tutununue mbili.

61
00:03:19,863 --> 00:03:21,903
Tufanye hivyo.

62
00:03:21,927 --> 00:03:24,816
Ninaona nitaona njaa.

63
00:03:24,839 --> 00:03:28,053
Basi, tutaonana Jumamosi.

64
00:03:28,076 --> 00:03:31,310
Ndiyo, ninasubiri kwa hamu.

65
00:03:31,333 --> 00:03:34,338
Basi, tutaonana Jumamosi.

66
00:03:34,361 --> 00:03:41,466
Kiungo cha kurudia video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na ukaguzi wa juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

67
00:03:41,466 --> 00:03:44,466
Sehemu ya 2: Uzoefu wa Chakula na Rafiki / Uzoefu wa Kula na Marafiki

68
00:03:44,466 --> 00:03:50,202
Jana nilikwenda mgahawa na rafiki zangu.

69
00:03:50,225 --> 00:03:52,116
Nzuri sana!

70
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:55,140
Ulikula nini?

71
00:03:55,163 --> 00:03:58,702
Nilikula vyakula vingi tofauti.

72
00:03:58,725 --> 00:04:02,392
Nilikula kari na keki.

73
00:04:02,415 --> 00:04:05,748
Kari na keki?

74
00:04:05,771 --> 00:04:09,371
Mchanganyiko wa ajabu!

75
00:04:09,394 --> 00:04:11,127
Ndiyo.

76
00:04:11,150 --> 00:04:15,221
Kari ilikuwa kali sana.

77
00:04:15,245 --> 00:04:18,411
Unapenda vyakula vikali?

78
00:04:18,434 --> 00:04:20,268
Ndiyo.

79
00:04:20,291 --> 00:04:24,424
Ilikuwa kali, lakini tamu sana.

80
00:04:24,447 --> 00:04:27,090
Vizuri sana!

81
00:04:27,114 --> 00:04:30,084
Keki ilikuwaje?

82
00:04:30,107 --> 00:04:34,074
Keki ilikuwa tamu sana.

83
00:04:34,097 --> 00:04:36,669
Keki ya stroberi?

84
00:04:36,692 --> 00:04:38,567
Ndiyo.

85
00:04:38,591 --> 00:04:42,363
Stroberi zilikuwa nyingi.

86
00:04:42,386 --> 00:04:44,827
Ilikuwa nzuri.

87
00:04:44,850 --> 00:04:47,916
Vitu tamu ni vizuri.

88
00:04:47,939 --> 00:04:51,013
Ulikula chochote kingine?

89
00:04:51,037 --> 00:04:55,313
Nilikunywa juisi iliyokuwa na limau.

90
00:04:55,336 --> 00:04:58,336
Je, juisi ilikuwa chungu?

91
00:04:58,359 --> 00:05:01,617
Ilikuwa chungu sana.

92
00:05:01,641 --> 00:05:05,774
Lakini, ilifanya kinywa changu kufurahia.

93
00:05:05,797 --> 00:05:10,564
Vitu vichungu ni vyema kwa afya.

94
00:05:10,587 --> 00:05:12,220
Ndiyo.

95
00:05:12,243 --> 00:05:17,012
Kisha, mwishowe nilikunywa chai ya kijani.

96
00:05:17,035 --> 00:05:19,835
Chai ya kijani ilikuwaje?

97
00:05:19,858 --> 00:05:23,825
Chai ya kijani ilikuwa chungu kidogo.

98
00:05:23,848 --> 00:05:26,981
Je, huwezi kuvumilia chai chungu?

99
00:05:27,004 --> 00:05:34,338
Hapana, nilikunywa baada ya keki tamu, hivyo ilifaa sana.

100
00:05:34,361 --> 00:05:35,894
Nimeelewa.

101
00:05:35,917 --> 00:05:38,406
Hiyo ni ladha ya watu wazima.

102
00:05:38,429 --> 00:05:40,363
Ndiyo.

103
00:05:40,386 --> 00:05:43,152
Chai ilikuwa tamu sana.

104
00:05:43,175 --> 00:05:46,942
Je, ungependa kurudi mgahawa huo tena?

105
00:05:46,965 --> 00:05:48,698
Ndiyo.

106
00:05:48,721 --> 00:05:52,255
Nitakwenda tena wiki ijayo.

107
00:05:52,278 --> 00:05:55,211
Utakula nini kesho?

108
00:05:55,234 --> 00:06:00,410
Ningependa kula chakula cha samaki na kari.

109
00:06:00,434 --> 00:06:03,601
Je, chakula cha samaki ni maarufu?

110
00:06:03,624 --> 00:06:08,302
Rafiki zangu walisema ilikuwa tamu sana.

111
00:06:08,325 --> 00:06:12,408
Ningependa kwenda mgahawani huo pia.

112
00:06:12,432 --> 00:06:15,065
Siku gani itakuwa nzuri?

113
00:06:15,088 --> 00:06:24,770
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali uandike maoni.

114
00:06:24,770 --> 00:06:27,770
Sehemu ya 3: Kumbukumbu za Safari

115
00:06:27,770 --> 00:06:32,979
Wiki iliyopita tulikuwa na likizo ndefu, sivyo?

116
00:06:33,002 --> 00:06:36,242
Ulienda mahali popote?

117
00:06:36,266 --> 00:06:37,999
Ndiyo.

118
00:06:38,022 --> 00:06:43,959
Nilienda Tokyo, Kyoto na Okinawa.

119
00:06:43,983 --> 00:06:46,160
Haya ni ya ajabu!

120
00:06:46,184 --> 00:06:50,318
Umekwenda maeneo mengi sana.

121
00:06:50,342 --> 00:06:52,075
Ndiyo.

122
00:06:52,098 --> 00:06:55,431
Safari ilikuwa ya haraka sana.

123
00:06:55,454 --> 00:06:58,393
Tokyo ilikuwaje?

124
00:06:58,417 --> 00:07:03,384
Tokyo ilikuwa na shughuli nyingi sana.

125
00:07:03,408 --> 00:07:06,408
Kulikuwa na watu wengi.

126
00:07:06,431 --> 00:07:09,997
Usafiri ulikuwa wa rahisi?

127
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:11,954
Ndiyo.

128
00:07:11,977 --> 00:07:17,350
Treni zilikuja upesi, hivyo zilikuwa za rahisi sana.

129
00:07:17,374 --> 00:07:20,386
Kyoto ilikuwaje?

130
00:07:20,409 --> 00:07:25,850
Kyoto ilikuwa mji wa zamani na tulivu sana.

131
00:07:25,873 --> 00:07:28,886
Hekalu zilikuwa nzuri?

132
00:07:28,910 --> 00:07:30,583
Ndiyo.

133
00:07:30,606 --> 00:07:34,006
Hekalu zilikuwa nzuri sana.

134
00:07:34,029 --> 00:07:37,514
Kulikuwa na majani mengi pia.

135
00:07:37,537 --> 00:07:39,711
Ni nzuri sana!

136
00:07:39,735 --> 00:07:42,701
Okinawa ilikuwaje?

137
00:07:42,724 --> 00:07:47,058
Okinawa ilikuwa joto sana.

138
00:07:47,081 --> 00:07:50,314
Hali ya hewa ilikuwa nzuri.

139
00:07:50,337 --> 00:07:53,153
Uliuona bahari?

140
00:07:53,176 --> 00:07:54,820
Ndiyo.

141
00:07:54,844 --> 00:07:59,299
Bahari ilikuwa pana na ya buluu sana.

142
00:07:59,322 --> 00:08:02,803
Uliogelea?

143
00:08:02,826 --> 00:08:06,264
Hapana, sikugelea.

144
00:08:06,288 --> 00:08:10,488
Lakini nilitembea karibu.

145
00:08:10,511 --> 00:08:15,790
Kati ya maeneo matatu, mahali gani palikuwa bora zaidi?

146
00:08:15,813 --> 00:08:20,258
Nilikupenda Kyoto zaidi.

147
00:08:20,281 --> 00:08:23,695
Napenda mahali penye utulivu.

148
00:08:23,719 --> 00:08:26,799
Okinawa ilikuwa mbali?

149
00:08:26,822 --> 00:08:33,311
Nilikulia eropleni kwa saa mbili, hivyo ilikuwa mbali kidogo.

150
00:08:33,334 --> 00:08:35,167
Nimeelewa.

151
00:08:35,190 --> 00:08:38,793
Asili nyingi ni nzuri, sivyo?

152
00:08:38,817 --> 00:08:40,417
Ndiyo.

153
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:43,507
Ilikuwa uzoefu mzuri sana.

154
00:08:43,530 --> 00:08:48,263
Mwezi ujao nina mpango wa kusafiri.

155
00:08:48,286 --> 00:08:50,953
Unaenda wapi?

156
00:08:50,976 --> 00:08:54,376
Ninafikiri kwenda Kyoto.

157
00:08:54,399 --> 00:08:57,932
Ninataka kuona majengo ya kale.

158
00:08:57,955 --> 00:09:01,388
Kyoto ni nzuri sana.

159
00:09:01,411 --> 00:09:04,478
Kuna vyakula vitamu vingi vya asili.

160
00:09:04,501 --> 00:09:07,359
Nitakula nini?

161
00:09:07,382 --> 00:09:11,263
Aiskrimu ya matcha ni tamu sana.

162
00:09:11,287 --> 00:09:13,496
Tafadhali kula.

163
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:15,519
Nimeelewa.

164
00:09:15,542 --> 00:09:18,142
Nitakula bila shaka.

165
00:09:18,165 --> 00:09:21,165
Umeamua hoteli?

166
00:09:21,188 --> 00:09:24,722
Hapana, bado sijamaliza.

167
00:09:24,745 --> 00:09:27,311
Ni wapi panapofaa?

168
00:09:27,334 --> 00:09:31,701
Hoteli karibu na kituo cha treni ni rahisi sana.

169
00:09:31,724 --> 00:09:33,769
Uhamisho ni rahisi.

170
00:09:33,793 --> 00:09:35,326
Ndiyo.

171
00:09:35,349 --> 00:09:38,682
Nitafuta kwa mtandao.

172
00:09:38,705 --> 00:09:42,072
Natumai utapata hoteli nzuri.

173
00:09:42,095 --> 00:09:43,534
Ndiyo.

174
00:09:43,557 --> 00:09:47,559
Napenda hoteli iliyo tulivu na safi.

175
00:09:47,583 --> 00:09:52,183
Usiku huko Kyoto ni mzuri sana, ufurahie.

176
00:09:52,206 --> 00:09:53,739
Asante sana.

177
00:09:53,762 --> 00:09:56,696
Nitapiga picha nyingi.

178
00:09:56,719 --> 00:10:00,519
Ninangojea zawadi zako kwa hamu.

179
00:10:00,542 --> 00:10:01,989
Ndiyo.

180
00:10:02,012 --> 00:10:04,945
Nitakununua vitambua tamu.

181
00:10:04,968 --> 00:10:08,208
Safari njema, na epuka hatari.

182
00:10:08,232 --> 00:10:11,232
Sehemu ya 4: Maisha Shuleni na Walimu

183
00:10:11,232 --> 00:10:15,598
Maisha yako shuleni mpya yanakuwaje?

184
00:10:15,621 --> 00:10:18,788
Yanafurahisha sana.

185
00:10:18,811 --> 00:10:22,744
Kila siku nakutana na watu wapya.

186
00:10:22,767 --> 00:10:24,837
Hiyo ni nzuri.

187
00:10:24,861 --> 00:10:28,904
Mwalimu wa Kijapani ni mtu wa aina gani?

188
00:10:28,928 --> 00:10:33,661
Mwalimu ni mkali kidogo.

189
00:10:33,684 --> 00:10:39,298
Anapoingia darasani, daima ana sura ya ukali.

190
00:10:39,321 --> 00:10:42,255
Je, anafundisha vizuri?

191
00:10:42,278 --> 00:10:43,811
Ndiyo.

192
00:10:43,834 --> 00:10:49,801
Anafundisha vizuri sana, kwa hiyo naelewa vyema.

193
00:10:49,824 --> 00:10:52,519
Hiyo ni faraja.

194
00:10:52,542 --> 00:10:56,075
Rafiki yako wa kazi ya muda ni aje?

195
00:10:56,098 --> 00:11:00,465
Yule ni mtu mzuri sana.

196
00:11:00,488 --> 00:11:02,821
Je, ni mtu mcheshi?

197
00:11:02,844 --> 00:11:04,494
Ndiyo.

198
00:11:04,518 --> 00:11:08,284
Daima anasema hadithi za kuchekesha.

199
00:11:08,307 --> 00:11:10,774
Tunacheka sana.

200
00:11:10,797 --> 00:11:14,764
Anakusaidia wakati wa shida?

201
00:11:14,787 --> 00:11:16,353
Ndiyo.

202
00:11:16,376 --> 00:11:22,027
Ananisaidia kwa upole daima, na hiyo inanifurahisha.

203
00:11:22,051 --> 00:11:24,460
Ni rafiki mzuri.

204
00:11:24,484 --> 00:11:27,734
Rafiki zako darasani ni aje?

205
00:11:27,758 --> 00:11:32,398
Rafiki zangu wote ni wenye nguvu sana.

206
00:11:32,421 --> 00:11:35,621
Na wana upole pia.

207
00:11:35,644 --> 00:11:38,244
Je, darasa ni la shughuli nyingi?

208
00:11:38,268 --> 00:11:39,956
Ndiyo.

209
00:11:39,979 --> 00:11:44,379
Wakati wa mapumziko, ni shughuli nyingi sana.

210
00:11:44,402 --> 00:11:47,202
Kila siku ni ya furaha.

211
00:11:47,225 --> 00:11:51,924
Una watu wazuri wengi karibu nawe.

212
00:11:51,947 --> 00:11:56,125
Nafikiri nina bahati nzuri.

213
00:11:56,149 --> 00:12:00,635
Umekwenda mahali pamoja na rafiki?

214
00:12:00,659 --> 00:12:06,192
Jumamosi iliyopita tulikwenda bustanini pamoja.

215
00:12:06,215 --> 00:12:09,215
Mlichukua nini bustanini?

216
00:12:09,238 --> 00:12:13,815
Tulicheza mpira, na kupiga picha.

217
00:12:13,838 --> 00:12:16,205
Hiyo inaonekana ya furaha.

218
00:12:16,228 --> 00:12:19,286
Ulikula chakula cha mchana?

219
00:12:19,310 --> 00:12:20,843
Ndiyo.

220
00:12:20,866 --> 00:12:26,345
Rafiki yangu alinipikia sandwichi tamu.

221
00:12:26,369 --> 00:12:29,446
Ni rafiki mwenye kupikia vyema.

222
00:12:29,469 --> 00:12:31,280
Ndiyo.

223
00:12:31,304 --> 00:12:34,183
Ilikuwa tamu sana.

224
00:12:34,207 --> 00:12:38,087
Mimi nilileta matunda.

225
00:12:38,110 --> 00:12:40,566
Ni matunda gani?

226
00:12:40,590 --> 00:12:44,072
Nilipeleka tufaha na ndizi.

227
00:12:44,096 --> 00:12:46,662
Tulikula pamoja.

228
00:12:46,685 --> 00:12:49,852
Wikendi ilikuwa nzuri sana, sivyo?

229
00:12:49,875 --> 00:12:51,445
Ndiyo.

230
00:12:51,468 --> 00:12:55,881
Mara ijayo, nataka kuwalika walimu pia.

231
00:12:55,905 --> 00:12:59,471
Walimu watafurahi sana.

232
00:12:59,494 --> 00:13:02,028
Tafadhali mwambie.

233
00:13:02,051 --> 00:13:06,386
Lakini, labda walimu wana shughuli nyingi.

234
00:13:06,409 --> 00:13:09,576
Hutajua mpaka uwaulize.

235
00:13:09,599 --> 00:13:11,599
Ndiyo.

236
00:13:11,622 --> 00:13:15,189
Nitawauliza kesho shuleni.

237
00:13:15,212 --> 00:13:18,145
Kama unaweza, mwalike wanafunzi wa miaka ya juu pia?

238
00:13:18,168 --> 00:13:20,175
Nzuri sana!

239
00:13:20,198 --> 00:13:24,232
Walisema wanapenda michezo.

240
00:13:24,255 --> 00:13:29,502
Watu wengi watakuwepo, itakuwa na shughuli zaidi.

241
00:13:29,526 --> 00:13:31,015
Ndiyo.

242
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:34,441
Inaonekana kama tukio kubwa litakalofanyika.

243
00:13:34,464 --> 00:13:37,343
Kupanga mpango kunanifurahisha sana.

244
00:13:37,367 --> 00:13:39,211
Ndiyo.

245
00:13:39,235 --> 00:13:42,968
Usiku huu nitafikiria ratiba.

246
00:13:42,991 --> 00:13:45,569
Jitahidi sana.

247
00:13:45,593 --> 00:13:47,793
Nakuunga mkono.

248
00:13:47,816 --> 00:13:49,583
Asante sana.

249
00:13:49,606 --> 00:13:52,178
Nitapanga mpango mzuri.

250
00:13:52,201 --> 00:13:55,201
Sehemu ya 5: Jinsi ya Kufurahia Anime / Enjoying Different Types of Anime

251
00:13:55,201 --> 00:14:00,451
Hivi karibuni, unaangalia anime yoyote?

252
00:14:00,475 --> 00:14:01,490
Ndiyo.

253
00:14:01,513 --> 00:14:05,247
Ninaangalia anime tatu kwa kawaida.

254
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:07,876
Unaangalia nyingi sana!

255
00:14:07,899 --> 00:14:10,232
Ni anime za aina gani?

256
00:14:10,255 --> 00:14:16,622
Anime ya mapigano, anime ya michezo, na anime ya maisha ya kila siku.

257
00:14:16,645 --> 00:14:19,811
Anime ya mapigano inakuwaje?

258
00:14:19,834 --> 00:14:22,768
Inaonekana kuwa nzuri mno.

259
00:14:22,791 --> 00:14:25,724
Inajulikana duniani kote.

260
00:14:25,747 --> 00:14:28,380
Je, ni anime yenye shughuli nyingi?

261
00:14:28,403 --> 00:14:29,970
Ndiyo.

262
00:14:29,993 --> 00:14:34,873
Muziki wake ni mkubwa na yenye shughuli nyingi sana.

263
00:14:34,897 --> 00:14:37,763
Anime ya michezo inakuwaje?

264
00:14:37,786 --> 00:14:42,397
Anime ya michezo ni ya moto mno.

265
00:14:42,421 --> 00:14:44,388
Inanipa nguvu.

266
00:14:44,411 --> 00:14:46,492
Je, ni ya kuvutia?

267
00:14:46,516 --> 00:14:48,249
Ndiyo.

268
00:14:48,272 --> 00:14:50,639
Ni ya kuvutia mno.

269
00:14:50,662 --> 00:14:53,951
Ninangoja kila wiki kwa hamu.

270
00:14:53,974 --> 00:14:57,153
Anime ya maisha ya kila siku inakuwaje?

271
00:14:57,177 --> 00:15:01,777
Anime ya maisha ya kila siku ni nzuri mno.

272
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:04,167
Je, ni hadithi tulivu?

273
00:15:04,190 --> 00:15:05,756
Ndiyo.

274
00:15:05,779 --> 00:15:09,752
Ni hadithi tulivu na ya polepole.

275
00:15:09,775 --> 00:15:12,175
Inanipa amani moyoni.

276
00:15:12,198 --> 00:15:17,565
Kati ya hizi tatu, ni ipi unayopenda zaidi?

277
00:15:17,588 --> 00:15:22,755
Ninapenda zaidi anime ya michezo.

278
00:15:22,778 --> 00:15:24,778
Kwa sababu inanifanya nijisikie vizuri.

279
00:15:24,801 --> 00:15:27,567
Je, unasoma manga pia?

280
00:15:27,590 --> 00:15:29,157
Ndiyo.

281
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:32,659
Ninasoma manga ya anime ya mapigano.

282
00:15:32,683 --> 00:15:35,326
Je, manga ni ya kuvutia?

283
00:15:35,349 --> 00:15:36,949
Ndiyo.

284
00:15:36,972 --> 00:15:40,642
Manga ina picha nzuri mno.

285
00:15:40,665 --> 00:15:43,603
Uliinunua dukani?

286
00:15:43,627 --> 00:15:47,714
Hapana, nasoma kwa simu yangu.

287
00:15:47,738 --> 00:15:49,777
Ni rahisi mno.

288
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:54,734
Simu za sasa zina skrini kubwa sana.

289
00:15:54,757 --> 00:15:56,123
Ndiyo.

290
00:15:56,146 --> 00:15:59,213
Unaweza kusoma popote pale.

291
00:15:59,236 --> 00:16:00,648
Ninapenda.

292
00:16:00,671 --> 00:16:04,005
Sikupendi sana kutazama anime.

293
00:16:04,028 --> 00:16:07,228
Una anime yoyote unayopendekeza?

294
00:16:07,251 --> 00:16:11,685
Kama ni hivyo, anime ya maisha ya kila siku ni nzuri.

295
00:16:11,708 --> 00:16:14,341
Ni fupi na rahisi kutazama.

296
00:16:14,364 --> 00:16:16,731
Jina lake ni nini?

297
00:16:16,754 --> 00:16:20,631
Ni anime inayoitwa "Maisha ya Utulivu".

298
00:16:20,654 --> 00:16:24,192
"Maisha ya Utulivu" basi.

299
00:16:24,216 --> 00:16:26,467
Nitakikumbuka.

300
00:16:26,490 --> 00:16:29,764
Leo usiku, una muda?

301
00:16:29,788 --> 00:16:31,193
Ndiyo.

302
00:16:31,216 --> 00:16:33,425
Usiku niko huru.

303
00:16:33,449 --> 00:16:36,307
Sina mpango wowote.

304
00:16:36,331 --> 00:16:40,064
Basi, angalia kisa cha kwanza.

305
00:16:40,087 --> 00:16:42,946
Unaweza kuikuta kwenye mtandao.

306
00:16:42,970 --> 00:16:44,837
Nimeelewa.

307
00:16:44,859 --> 00:16:47,059
Nitaangalia.

308
00:16:47,082 --> 00:16:50,050
Nieleze mawazo yako.

309
00:16:50,074 --> 00:16:51,316
Ndiyo.

310
00:16:51,339 --> 00:16:54,339
Tutaongea shuleni kesho.

311
00:16:54,362 --> 00:16:57,929
Ningefurahi ukiipenda.

312
00:16:57,952 --> 00:17:00,354
Ninahisi hamu kubwa!

313
00:17:00,378 --> 00:17:03,645
Tangu zamani sikutazama anime mpya.

314
00:17:03,667 --> 00:17:06,201
Hakika utakuipenda.

315
00:17:06,224 --> 00:17:07,424
Ndiyo.

316
00:17:07,447 --> 00:17:10,918
Basi, nitakueleza mawazo yangu kesho.

317
00:17:10,942 --> 00:17:12,385
Ndiyo.

318
00:17:12,408 --> 00:17:14,808
Tutaonana kesho.

319
00:17:14,831 --> 00:17:17,831
Sehemu ya 6: Furaha ya Ununuzio

320
00:17:17,831 --> 00:17:23,564
Jana nilienda kununua vitu kwenye duka jipya lililofunguliwa.

321
00:17:23,587 --> 00:17:25,681
Nzuri sana!

322
00:17:25,704 --> 00:17:28,471
Ulinunua nini?

323
00:17:28,494 --> 00:17:33,661
Nilinunua viatu vya michezo vipya na simu mpya.

324
00:17:33,684 --> 00:17:36,622
Umenunua vitu vingi!

325
00:17:36,645 --> 00:17:40,516
Viatu vya michezo vipya vinaonekana vipi?

326
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:43,350
Ni nyepesi sana.

327
00:17:43,374 --> 00:17:48,040
Na pia rahisi kutembea navyo, kwa hiyo ninavyopenda.

328
00:17:48,063 --> 00:17:51,230
Hiyo ni nzuri.

329
00:17:51,253 --> 00:17:53,626
Zilikuwa na bei nafuu?

330
00:17:53,649 --> 00:17:57,386
Ndiyo, zilikuwa na bei nafuu sana.

331
00:17:57,409 --> 00:17:59,650
Zilikuwa shilingi elfu tano.

332
00:17:59,673 --> 00:18:03,073
Umefanya ununuzio mzuri!

333
00:18:03,096 --> 00:18:06,696
Simu mpya inakuwaje?

334
00:18:06,719 --> 00:18:11,553
Ni rahisi sana, lakini ilikuwa ghali.

335
00:18:11,576 --> 00:18:14,413
Skrini yake ni kubwa?

336
00:18:14,437 --> 00:18:21,105
Ndiyo, skrini ni kubwa, kwa hiyo ni rahisi kutazama video.

337
00:18:21,128 --> 00:18:23,222
Nzuri sana!

338
00:18:23,245 --> 00:18:26,850
Ulichukua chochote kingine?

339
00:18:26,874 --> 00:18:30,731
Kulikuwa na saa nzuri.

340
00:18:30,755 --> 00:18:33,890
Hukuinunua saa hiyo?

341
00:18:33,913 --> 00:18:41,124
Hapana, muundo wake ulikuwa mzuri, lakini ilikuwa nzito kidogo, kwa hiyo sikuinunua.

342
00:18:41,148 --> 00:18:42,926
Nimeelewa.

343
00:18:42,949 --> 00:18:47,982
Vitu unavyotumia kila siku ni vyema viwe nyepesi.

344
00:18:48,005 --> 00:18:50,839
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

345
00:18:50,862 --> 00:18:54,528
Pia nilitazama koti ya baridi.

346
00:18:54,551 --> 00:18:57,797
Koti ilikuwaje?

347
00:18:57,821 --> 00:19:00,787
Ilikuwa inaonekana kuwa na joto sana.

348
00:19:00,810 --> 00:19:03,622
UliiNunua?

349
00:19:03,646 --> 00:19:09,450
Hapana, sikununua kwa sababu rangi haikupendeza.

350
00:19:09,473 --> 00:19:13,728
Ununuzi ni mgumu, lakini ni furaha pia.

351
00:19:13,752 --> 00:19:21,441
Ndiyo, kati ya viatu vya michezo na simu ya mkononi, viatu vya michezo vilikuwa ununuzi bora zaidi.

352
00:19:21,464 --> 00:19:26,121
Mimi pia nataka kwenda maduka hayo ya rejareja siku zijazo.

353
00:19:26,145 --> 00:19:30,178
Je, tutaenda pamoja wiki ijayo?

354
00:19:30,201 --> 00:19:32,135
Nzuri sana!

355
00:19:32,158 --> 00:19:34,758
Twende pamoja.

356
00:19:34,781 --> 00:19:37,781
Sehemu ya 7: Kutembelea Mikahawa na Migahawa na Marafiki

357
00:19:37,781 --> 00:19:42,381
Wiki iliyopita, nilitoka na marafiki.

358
00:19:42,404 --> 00:19:44,940
Mlienda wapi?

359
00:19:44,963 --> 00:19:50,580
Tulikwenda kwenye mkahawa mpya na mgahawa karibu na kituo cha treni.

360
00:19:50,604 --> 00:19:52,570
Nzuri sana!

361
00:19:52,593 --> 00:19:56,327
Mkahawa mpya ulikuwaje?

362
00:19:56,350 --> 00:19:59,350
Mahali palikuwa pa amani sana.

363
00:19:59,373 --> 00:20:02,973
Kahawa ilikuwa tamu sana.

364
00:20:02,996 --> 00:20:05,562
Duka lilikuwa safi?

365
00:20:05,585 --> 00:20:10,152
Ndiyo, lilikuwa safi sana na la mitindo.

366
00:20:10,175 --> 00:20:12,975
Kulikuwa na watu wengi?

367
00:20:12,998 --> 00:20:17,815
Hapana, walikuwa wachache tu.

368
00:20:17,838 --> 00:20:20,838
Niliweza kupumzika kwa utulivu.

369
00:20:20,861 --> 00:20:23,676
Hiyo ni mkahawa mzuri sana.

370
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:26,833
Mgahawa ulikuwaje?

371
00:20:26,856 --> 00:20:30,856
Mgahawa ulikuwa na shughuli nyingi sana.

372
00:20:30,879 --> 00:20:33,547
Huduma ilikuwaje?

373
00:20:33,571 --> 00:20:37,142
Huduma ilikuwa nzuri sana.

374
00:20:37,166 --> 00:20:40,699
Wafanyakazi wote walikuwa wakaribu.

375
00:20:40,722 --> 00:20:43,455
Chakula kilikuwa kitamu?

376
00:20:43,478 --> 00:20:47,212
Ndiyo, kilikuwa kitamu sana.

377
00:20:47,235 --> 00:20:51,468
Lakini, bei ilikuwa ghali kidogo.

378
00:20:51,491 --> 00:20:54,362
Ni mgahawa unaofaa kwa siku maalum.

379
00:20:54,385 --> 00:20:57,189
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

380
00:20:57,213 --> 00:21:01,663
Baadaye, tulienda maduka makubwa maarufu.

381
00:21:01,686 --> 00:21:04,420
Maduka makubwa yalikuwaje?

382
00:21:04,443 --> 00:21:07,043
Yalikuwa na eneo pana sana.

383
00:21:07,066 --> 00:21:13,000
Na kwa sababu kulikuwa na watu wengi, nilichoka kidogo.

384
00:21:13,023 --> 00:21:17,877
Maduka makubwa ya Jumapili huwa na watu wengi.

385
00:21:17,901 --> 00:21:23,235
Ndiyo, kwa hiyo mwishowe tulienda duka la vitabu vya zamani.

386
00:21:23,258 --> 00:21:26,191
Duka la vitabu lilikuwaje?

387
00:21:26,214 --> 00:21:31,381
Lilikuwa na giza kidogo, lakini kulikuwa na vitabu vingi vya kuvutia.

388
00:21:31,404 --> 00:21:36,337
Kati ya mahali hapo manne, ulipenda zaidi wapi?

389
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:41,094
Nakupenda mkahawa mpya zaidi.

390
00:21:41,117 --> 00:21:43,208
Nataka kwenda tena.

391
00:21:43,231 --> 00:21:47,442
Mwambie jina la duka hilo siku zijazo.

392
00:21:47,466 --> 00:21:50,466
Sehemu ya 8: Kufanya Shughuli za Msimu Nchini Japani

393
00:21:50,466 --> 00:21:55,099
Nimeishi Japani kwa mwaka mmoja.

394
00:21:55,122 --> 00:21:59,090
Kweli? Muda umeenda haraka sana.

395
00:21:59,114 --> 00:22:00,847
Ndiyo.

396
00:22:00,870 --> 00:22:06,471
Nimefanya shughuli nyingi za msimu katika mwaka mmoja.

397
00:22:06,494 --> 00:22:10,571
Ni nini kilichoacha kumbukumbu zaidi?

398
00:22:10,594 --> 00:22:14,885
Ni sherehe za majira ya joto na maonyesho ya moto.

399
00:22:14,909 --> 00:22:17,676
Sherehe ilikuwaje?

400
00:22:17,699 --> 00:22:20,432
Ilikuwa na shughuli nyingi sana.

401
00:22:20,455 --> 00:22:23,489
Watu walikuwa wengi sana.

402
00:22:23,511 --> 00:22:25,645
Ulikuwa unafurahia?

403
00:22:25,668 --> 00:22:29,634
Ndiyo, nilifurahia sana.

404
00:22:29,657 --> 00:22:31,860
Nilivaa yukata.

405
00:22:31,884 --> 00:22:33,684
Nzuri sana!

406
00:22:33,707 --> 00:22:36,920
Matukio ya kutazama maua ya spring yalikuaje?

407
00:22:36,944 --> 00:22:41,150
Sakura katika bustani ilikuwa nzuri sana.

408
00:22:41,173 --> 00:22:44,573
Ulikula chakula cha mchana na marafiki?

409
00:22:44,596 --> 00:22:50,363
Ndiyo, chakula kilichokula pamoja kilikuwa kitamu sana.

410
00:22:50,386 --> 00:22:52,919
Hiyo ni nzuri.

411
00:22:52,942 --> 00:22:56,315
Katika majira ya autumn, ulienda mahali popote?

412
00:22:56,338 --> 00:23:00,938
Ndiyo, nilienda mlimani kuona majani mekundu.

413
00:23:00,961 --> 00:23:03,929
Majani mekundu yalikuaje?

414
00:23:03,953 --> 00:23:07,807
Mlima ulikuwa mwekundu na ulionekana mzuri sana.

415
00:23:07,830 --> 00:23:11,363
Lakini, ilikuwa baridi kidogo.

416
00:23:11,386 --> 00:23:15,753
Hali ya hewa mlimani katika majira ya autumn hubadilika kwa urahisi.

417
00:23:15,776 --> 00:23:20,943
Ndiyo. Na katika majira ya winter, nilienda kwenye sherehe ya theluji.

418
00:23:20,966 --> 00:23:23,574
Sherehe ya theluji ilikuaje?

419
00:23:23,597 --> 00:23:26,764
Ilikuwa baridi sana.

420
00:23:26,787 --> 00:23:31,798
Lakini, sanamu za theluji nyeupe zilikuwa nzuri.

421
00:23:31,822 --> 00:23:36,662
Kati ya matukio manne, ni yapi uliloathiriwa zaidi?

422
00:23:36,685 --> 00:23:41,419
Ninapenda zaidi sherehe za majira ya kiangazi.

423
00:23:41,442 --> 00:23:45,114
Napenda anasa ya mazingira yenye shughuli nyingi.

424
00:23:45,137 --> 00:23:49,616
Majira ya Japani kila moja ni tofauti na ya kuvutia, sivyo?

425
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:53,574
Ndiyo, naona hivyo kweli.

426
00:23:53,598 --> 00:23:56,598
Sehemu ya 9: Furaha na Changamoto za Kazi za Muda / Furaha na Changamoto za Kazi za Muda

427
00:23:56,598 --> 00:24:01,408
Hivi majuzi, nimeanza kazi mpya ya muda.

428
00:24:01,431 --> 00:24:03,564
Hiyo ni nzuri!

429
00:24:03,587 --> 00:24:06,120
Ni kazi gani?

430
00:24:06,143 --> 00:24:12,549
Ninafanya kazi katika duka la usiku na kwenye shule ya lugha ya Kijapani kama mpokeaji.

431
00:24:12,573 --> 00:24:15,606
Unafanya kazi mbili?

432
00:24:15,629 --> 00:24:18,207
Hiyo ni ngumu.

433
00:24:18,231 --> 00:24:21,475
Ndiyo, nina shughuli kidogo.

434
00:24:21,499 --> 00:24:24,432
Kazi ya duka la usiku inakuwaje?

435
00:24:24,455 --> 00:24:29,389
Kuna mambo mengi ya kukumbuka, hivyo ni ngumu.

436
00:24:29,412 --> 00:24:31,465
Je, ni ya kuvutia?

437
00:24:31,488 --> 00:24:38,426
Ndiyo, ni ngumu, lakini bidhaa nyingi zinazopatikana ni za kuvutia.

438
00:24:38,450 --> 00:24:41,650
Kazi ya mpokeaji katika shule ya Kijapani inakuwaje?

439
00:24:41,673 --> 00:24:46,966
Ninazungumza na watu kutoka nchi mbalimbali, hivyo ni furaha sana.

440
00:24:46,990 --> 00:24:49,867
Ni kazi muhimu.

441
00:24:49,890 --> 00:24:56,738
Ndiyo, kuna hati muhimu nyingi, kwa hivyo ninafanya kazi kwa bidii.

442
00:24:56,762 --> 00:25:01,095
Ni kazi ipi inakufaa zaidi?

443
00:25:01,118 --> 00:25:05,403
Ninapenda zaidi kazi ya mpokeaji.

444
00:25:05,426 --> 00:25:09,893
Napenda kuzungumza na watu.

445
00:25:09,916 --> 00:25:13,723
Kabla ya hapo, ulikuwa unafanya kazi katika jiko la mgahawa, sivyo?

446
00:25:13,747 --> 00:25:16,013
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

447
00:25:16,036 --> 00:25:18,970
Kazi ya jikoni ilikuwaje?

448
00:25:18,993 --> 00:25:23,726
Chumba kilikuwa na joto sana, hivyo ilikuwa ngumu.

449
00:25:23,749 --> 00:25:25,839
Ilikuwa na shughuli nyingi?

450
00:25:25,863 --> 00:25:29,863
Ndiyo, ilikuwa na shughuli nyingi sana.

451
00:25:29,886 --> 00:25:33,696
Lakini, nilikuwa na ujuzi wa kupika.

452
00:25:33,719 --> 00:25:36,786
Hiyo ilikuwa ni uzoefu mzuri.

453
00:25:36,809 --> 00:25:44,296
Ndiyo, kazi zangu za sasa zote zina watu wazuri na wema.

454
00:25:44,320 --> 00:25:46,732
Hiyo ni furaha kusikia.

455
00:25:46,755 --> 00:25:50,724
Jihadhari na mwili wako na ushinde.

456
00:25:50,747 --> 00:25:52,514
Asante sana.

457
00:25:52,537 --> 00:25:54,704
Nitashinda.

458
00:25:54,727 --> 00:25:57,727
Mandhari 10: Jinsi ya Kupita Wikiendi

459
00:25:57,727 --> 00:26:03,360
Mwezi huu, niliwahi kufanya mambo mbalimbali katika wikiendi.

460
00:26:03,383 --> 00:26:06,070
Uliwahi kufanya nini?

461
00:26:06,094 --> 00:26:12,160
Wikiendi ya kwanza, nilikaa nyumbani nikisoma kitabu kwa utulivu.

462
00:26:12,183 --> 00:26:14,917
Ulisoma kitabu vipi?

463
00:26:14,940 --> 00:26:20,994
Nyumbani kulikuwa kimya, kwa hiyo niliweza kusoma vizuri.

464
00:26:21,017 --> 00:26:24,229
Kitabu kilikuwa cha kuvutia?

465
00:26:24,253 --> 00:26:28,858
Hapana, hazikuwa nzuri sana.

466
00:26:28,882 --> 00:26:31,524
Hiyo ilikuwa ya kusikitisha.

467
00:26:31,547 --> 00:26:36,080
Wikiendi iliyofuata uliwahi kufanya nini?

468
00:26:36,103 --> 00:26:39,237
Nilicheza tenisi na marafiki.

469
00:26:39,260 --> 00:26:41,543
Michezo ni nzuri sana.

470
00:26:41,566 --> 00:26:43,771
Ilikuwaje?

471
00:26:43,794 --> 00:26:47,054
Mwili wangu ulikuwa moto.

472
00:26:47,078 --> 00:26:52,444
Nilijisikia nguvu sana, lakini siku iliyofuata nilichoka.

473
00:26:52,467 --> 00:26:56,301
Kwa kawaida huwa si mwenda kwenye mazoezi mara nyingi.

474
00:26:56,323 --> 00:26:59,523
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

475
00:26:59,546 --> 00:27:05,021
Wikiendi iliyofuata, nilienda sinema kutazama filamu.

476
00:27:05,045 --> 00:27:07,688
Filamu ilikuwaje?

477
00:27:07,712 --> 00:27:11,998
Sauti ilikuwa kubwa sana.

478
00:27:12,021 --> 00:27:15,675
Ilikuwa na nguvu sana, nikashangaa mno.

479
00:27:15,698 --> 00:27:19,311
Filamu zinazotazamwa sinema ni maalum sana.

480
00:27:19,335 --> 00:27:22,968
Ndiyo, zilikuwa nzuri mno.

481
00:27:22,991 --> 00:27:29,686
Kisha, wikiendi ya mwisho, nilienda kupanda mlima karibu.

482
00:27:29,710 --> 00:27:32,489
Kupanda mlima kulikuwaje?

483
00:27:32,512 --> 00:27:35,314
Hali ya hewa ilikuwa nzuri.

484
00:27:35,338 --> 00:27:39,139
Hewa ilikuwa tamu sana.

485
00:27:39,162 --> 00:27:40,829
Ilikuwa mbali?

486
00:27:40,852 --> 00:27:45,260
Ndiyo, ilikuwa mbali kidogo.

487
00:27:45,283 --> 00:27:49,856
Nilisogea sana, kwa hiyo miguu yangu iliuma.

488
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:54,647
Kati ya wikiendi nne, ni ipi iliyokuwa ya kupendeza zaidi?

489
00:27:54,670 --> 00:27:59,270
Kupanda mlima ndilo lililonipa furaha zaidi.

490
00:27:59,293 --> 00:28:02,893
Kwa sababu kulikuwa na asili nyingi.

491
00:28:02,916 --> 00:28:05,916
Mwezi mzuri ulikuwa, sivyo?

492
00:28:05,939 --> 00:28:10,272
Ndiyo, likiwa likiwa na likiwa la kupendeza mno.